OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal owners call for more
OL,4,Afirework restrictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnimal owners in Guernsey are calling
OL,7,Ffor more restrictions around firework
OL,8,Fdisplays.
OL,10,FDisplays were held across the island in
OL,11,Fearly November to mark Budloe, bonfire
OL,12,For Guy Fawkes night, but some people
OL,13,Fsaid the unpredictability of private
OL,14,Fdisplays meant they were unable to
OL,15,Fprepare.
OL,17,FDenise Fallaize said a burn mark
OL,18,Fbelieved to be caused by rocket
OL,19,Fremnants was found on one of her
OL,20,Fsheep's fleece, while another animal
OL,21,Fowner, Sara Clarke, said the event was
OL,22,F"absolutely horrendous" for her dog.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
