OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal owners call for more
OL,4,Afirework restrictions
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the issue, Deputy Adrian Gabriel,
OL,7,FPresident of the Committee for the
OL,8,FEnvironment & Infrastructure, said:
OL,9,F"We'll be reviewing our strategic
OL,10,Fpriorities at the end of this year."
